/// `return make_seg_exception(..)`/`make_pf_exception(..)` become
/// `out.flags = flags_reg; out.lazy = LazyOp::None; return ArmFlow::Return(..)`.
/// The #UD path keeps its verbatim `set_eip`/`materialize_flags`/`cpu.regs.flags`
/// preamble, then goes through `ret!`.  `ram` is rebased by `vga_aware_write_u16`
